Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:23:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 6: learning resources, FastAPI service, Streamlit app

- data/reference/learning_resources.csv (60 authored entries, 54 of 70 skills) and
  src/recommendation/learning.py (validated catalog, priority/difficulty/free-only selection)
- recommend.py: attaches a primary resource, alternatives or an explicit note to every gap;
  --resources and --free-only options
- api/main.py: /health, /skills, /careers, /recommend with strict validation, 503 when data
  is not built, stateless, disclaimer and data limits in every response
- src/product/client.py + app/streamlit_app.py: skill picker, ranked matches, evidence,
  prioritised gaps with learning links, synthetic-data banner, escaped user text
- scripts/smoke_phase6.sh: recommendation -> uvicorn -> streamlit against real servers
- requirements-phase6.txt, tests/test_phase6_product.py (3 tests, real uvicorn + AppTest),
  docs/phase6_product.md; two Phase 5 assertions updated from 'resources arrive in Phase 6'

Links not machine-verified (two spot-checked); no browser rendering checked; no auth (Phase 7).
